      "keys": [
        "Conflagration"
      ],
      "evidence": "3.29.3 (2026-08-12, after PoB v2.67.2 of 2026-08-07): 'Fixed a bug introduced in 3.29 which caused level one Conflagration to deal no damage and fire many more projectiles than intended.' PoB's level 1 row is the bugged one (8 projectiles, no damage stat); its stat order, taken from level 1, then puts every later level's values under the wrong stat names. PoB's later re-export (dev, 2026-10-29) has the bundle's level 1 and order.",
      "sources": [
        "https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/3996516",
        "v2.67.2:src/Data/Skills/act_dex.lua (Conflagration levels[1])",
        "pob@3dbca4463c0a59079d9f7f032d8240cf868e09da:src/Data/Skills/act_dex.lua:4305"
      ]
